{"id":"59d9dc7ce0d1cae1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-stage-expansion.md","title":"df finite stage expansion","display":"df finite stage expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-stage-expansion","aliases":["72-df-finite-stage-expansion"],"display":"df finite stage expansion","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]","[[72-df-program-definition-form]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition3.4.1 and Lemma3.4.2, print654–655/PDF666–667; assignment version on a fixed base","verification_status":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note by lexicographic recursion and structural induction","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-stage-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-stage-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df finite stage expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fdc7a7a93d79109\" href=\"?note=7fdc7a7a93d79109\" title=\"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration\">72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition3.4.1 and Lemma3.4.2, print654–655/PDF666–667; assignment version on a fixed base"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-statement-checked; local induction checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by lexicographic recursion and structural induction"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n\">\\(P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fdc7a7a93d79109\" href=\"?note=7fdc7a7a93d79109\" title=\"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration\">72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P(\\vec t)\">\\(D_R^P(\\vec t)\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a> 中固定枚举和最小新鲜变量算法给出的确定公式，不另选择任意的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 代表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0\">\\(B_0\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{t\\doteq u,t\\ne u:t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\">\\(\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{t\\doteq u,t\\ne u:t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}\\)</span> 是下式递归给出的关系符号出现集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为该集合为空的 LP 公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_P^n\">\\(E_P^n\\)</span> 的输出取等式公式，按先 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、后当前输入公式树高的字典序递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B_0)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\{R\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(QxA):=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nE_P^n(B_0)&amp;:=B_0,\\\\\nE_P^0(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\bot,\\qquad E_P^0(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\bot,\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=E_P^n(D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(\\overline R(\\vec t))&amp;:=E_P^n(\\sim D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^n(A\\circ B)&amp;:=E_P^n(A)\\circ E_P^n(B),\\\\\nE_P^n(QxA)&amp;:=QxE_P^n(A),\\\\\nE_P^n&amp;:\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\longrightarrow\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{J_P^n,s})_+=1&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ E_P^n(A)⟧_{U,s}=\\mathsf t.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B_0)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\{R\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(QxA):=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nE_P^n(B_0)&amp;:=B_0,\\\\\nE_P^0(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\bot,\\qquad E_P^0(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\bot,\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=E_P^n(D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(\\overline R(\\vec t))&amp;:=E_P^n(\\sim D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^n(A\\circ B)&amp;:=E_P^n(A)\\circ E_P^n(B),\\\\\nE_P^n(QxA)&amp;:=QxE_P^n(A),\\\\\nE_P^n&amp;:\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\longrightarrow\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{J_P^n,s})_+=1&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ E_P^n(A)⟧_{U,s}=\\mathsf t.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PDF666 页图核对了正负字面量的两个后继分支；负分支是先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim D_R^P\">\\(\\sim D_R^P\\)</span> 再展开，不能改成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim E_P^n(D_R^P)\">\\(\\sim E_P^n(D_R^P)\\)</span>。关系字面量在第零阶段的两种极性都展开成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>，这正是未定义值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,0)\">\\((0,0)\\)</span> 的两个证据坐标。</p>\n<p>每个后继字面量分支严格减小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，联结词与量词分支保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 而减小公式树高，故递归良基、输出唯一且不含关系符号。语义式用同一字典序归纳：第零阶段关系坐标为 0；后继阶段按 envelope 的定义和否定交换坐标；合取、析取、量词的正坐标分别是布尔合取、析取、全称和存在运算。等式公式的值仅依赖基底，故右侧可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 中计算。这里核对了 Lemma 3.4.2 的赋值版本，未加入需要 Theorem 2.5.1 的 CET 推导等价式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n$ 取 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]，$A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$n\\in\\omega$，$s\\in D^V$。$R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$，$\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}$，$x\\in V$。$D_R^P(\\vec t)$ 直接取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 中固定枚举和最小新鲜变量算法给出的确定公式，不另选择任意的 $\\alpha$ 代表。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n$ 取 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]，$A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$n\\in\\omega$，$s\\in D^V$。$R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$，$\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}$，$x\\in V$。$D_R^P(\\vec t)$ 直接取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 中固定枚举和最小新鲜变量算法给出的确定公式，不另选择任意的 $\\alpha$ 代表。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\cup\\{t\\doteq u,t\\ne u:t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"E_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B_0)&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(R(\\vec t))&:=\\{R\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A\\circ B)&:=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(B),\\qquad\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(QxA):=\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma&:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Rel}_{LP}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nE_P^n(B_0)&:=B_0,\\\\\nE_P^0(R(\\vec t))&:=\\bot,\\qquad E_P^0(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\bot,\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(R(\\vec t))&:=E_P^n(D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^{n+1}(\\overline R(\\vec t))&:=E_P^n(\\sim D_R^P(\\vec t)),\\\\\nE_P^n(A\\circ B)&:=E_P^n(A)\\circ E_P^n(B),\\\\\nE_P^n(QxA)&:=QxE_P^n(A),\\\\\nE_P^n&:\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\longrightarrow\\mathsf{EqFml}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n(⟦ A⟧_{J_P^n,s})_+=1&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ E_P^n(A)⟧_{U,s}=\\mathsf t.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim D_R^P","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim E_P^n(D_R^P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"(0,0)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":3154,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-stage-expansion|df finite stage expansion]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df finite stage expansion](72-df-finite-stage-expansion.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-stage-expansion]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-396","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-finite-stage-expansion|df finite stage expansion]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-finite-stage-expansion]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-finite-stage-expansion]]"}],"outgoing":["7fdc7a7a93d79109","d9586f246c1c6084"]}